Package: com.buffy.cardboardos
Name: CardboardOS
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Turns the whole iOS 12 UI into a lens-corrected stereoscopic image for Google Cardboard, fully navigable with the viewer button alone.
